{
  "schema_version": "1.7.0",
  "id": "USN-8970-1",
  "summary": "gvfs vulnerabilities",
  "details": "It was discovered that GVfs did not properly validate data returned by\nan SFTP server. A remote attacker could possibly use this issue to\nobtain sensitive information.\n(CVE-2026-84267)\n\nIt was discovered that GVfs did not properly validate the size of\nreplies from an AFP server. A remote attacker could possibly use this\nissue to cause a denial of service.\n(CVE-2026-84269)\n\nIt was discovered that GVfs did not properly validate the size of data\nreturned by an MTP device. An attacker with a malicious MTP device\ncould possibly use this issue to cause a denial of service.\n(CVE-2026-84270)",
